pictures dragon green ~
The pictures tell about this mighty dragon. Apparently it fed upon the
giants of this forest more than other creatures. The giants finally 
decided to do something and tricked the dragon into crossing to a small island 
(many giants died doing this). Once the dragon had crossed the bridge the
giants used some sort of ancient magic to destroy the natural bridge joining
the two islands and to put the dragon into a deep sleep ... forever sealing the  
dragon on another island never to terrorize the villagers again.
